# index/store.json is a purely local ingest-time embedding-reuse cache
# again (same role as Seth_Wiki's version) now that retrieval runs on
# index/lancedb/ instead. index/lancedb/ IS committed, unlike Seth_Wiki:
# this corpus is a small, fixed ~12-doc demo (not a growing personal
# wiki), and a Streamlit Cloud deployment can't run `npm run ingest`
# itself — committing the pre-built LanceDB table is what lets the
# deployed app work at all.
index/store.json
